{"id": "t060-051", "text": "Omar's wife Sara had her 12 week scan Tuesday morning, all fine. They're telling family at Christmas.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "12 week scan", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas"}]}
