{"id": "t060-053", "text": "Isabel Reyes in accounts is retiring in March 2027. Twenty years there. Collection probably in Feb. Loves gin and cooking shows.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isabel Reyes", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in accounts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Twenty years there", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in Feb"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "gin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cooking shows", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t060-054", "text": "Farid's son passed his driving test this morning, first go! Farid's terrified now about him having the car.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t060-055", "text": "Kai's 30th is 14 February 2027 which he hates because Valentine's. He wants to do a weekend in the Lakes with everyone instead, Friday to Sunday, cottage near Keswick. Booking needs to happen by end of November apparently and Alana is organising. He's really into fell running and craft beer at the moment, so either of those for a present. Need to send Alana the deposit by Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "30th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 February 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "weekend in the Lakes", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday to Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by end of November"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fell running", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "craft beer", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Alana the deposit", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t060-056", "text": "Mohammed's dad passed away on Sunday. Funeral is Friday at 11 at the mosque on Green Lane. Need to message Mohammed tonight and ask if they need anything.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 11", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Mohammed", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask if they need anything", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t060-057", "text": "Lunch w Katarzyna. Her daughter starts uni in Edinburgh next September, so September 2027, and she's already panicking about it. Kat's into wild swimming lately, goes every Sunday morning at 8 even in winter. Mad. Maybe a dryrobe for xmas?", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Katarzyna", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni in Edinburgh", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kat", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "wild swimming", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Sunday morning at 8"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in winter"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "xmas"}]}
{"id": "t060-058", "text": "Andre's first day as a paramedic was yesterday. Remind me Saturday to see how the first week went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first day as a paramedic", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "see how the first week went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t060-059", "text": "Long chat with Jaya on the phone, nearly an hour. Her sister Rachel's moving back from Australia in the new year, January 2027 probably, with her two kids. They'll stay with Jaya's parents for a bit until they find a place. Jaya's excited but her mum is anxious about the space. Jaya also says the job is going well, she got promoted to senior analyst last month. Should send her flowers, I never congratulated her properly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back from Australia", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "January 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until they find a place"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious about the space", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promoted to senior analyst", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
